## Step 3-4: Statistically Significant Results (AUDIO, tau=0.50)

| Hypothesis | t-stat | p-value | σ_switching | σ_nonswitching | Direction Match |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Hyp-2** (B3+B6 Denial) | 3.35 | **0.0009** | 0.029 | 0.000 | ✅ |
| **Hyp-6** (Diagonal vs Adj) | 2.13 | **0.033** | 0.029 | 0.010 | ✅ |
| **Hyp-9** (Mirror Rate) | 2.50 | **0.015** | 0.523 | 0.200 | ❌ |

> [!NOTE]
> Hyp-9 shows mirror_rate is higher in *switching* (0.52), opposite of expectation. This suggests prior-clip emotion carries over during transitions.

